sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Team member
  participant R as Results editor
  participant RPC as sk_set_placements()
  participant DB as sk_placements
  participant V as sk_medal_table / sk_points_by_day
  participant RT as Supabase Realtime
  participant P as Public tally page
  R->>R: suggestedPodium(event, games, entries)
  R-->>S: "Ready to confirm" with places 1–3
  S->>R: check, adjust, Save results
  R->>RPC: rpc(p_event_id, rows[])
  RPC->>RPC: can_edit_sk()?
  RPC->>DB: delete event's placements, insert new rows<br/>(medal from place: 1 gold, 2 silver, 3 bronze)
  DB-->>RT: change on sk_placements
  RT-->>P: postgres_changes
  P->>V: refetch standings and timeline
  V-->>P: medals, points, rank (computed on read)
